      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would be opposed to allowing instances to be upgraded, as it is useful to me that I can make guarantees about the privacy of a session I'm in and not have it change.\nHowever, downgrading an instance seems reasonable.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
