  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the new additions of regions it would be cool, if you could upgrade instances from \"Invite\" up to \"Friends+\" and downgrade \"Friends+\" instances down to \"Invite\".\nIt would help when people are in their home world but want friend be able to join for example.",
